OL,3,GNEWSAPeace for villagers as US bombers
OL,4,Aleave UK airbase
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have welcomed the American
OL,7,Fmilitary pulling out from a UK military
OL,8,Fbase after months of noise and
OL,9,Fdisruption.
OL,11,FThe US has withdrawn all of its planes
OL,12,Ffrom RAF Fairford in Gloucestershire,
OL,13,Fwhich it has been using for airstrikes
OL,14,Fon Iran since March.
OL,16,FA major incident near the base last
OL,17,Fweek is still being investigated by
OL,18,Fcounter-terror police. Six men were
OL,19,Farrested on suspicion of terror
OL,20,Foffences and released on bail, and
OL,21,Fdozens of homes in Whelford were
OL,22,Fevacuated.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
