OL,3,GNEWSAPeace for villagers as US bombers
OL,4,Aleave UK airbase
OL,5,
OL,6,FDistrict councillor Tristan Wilkinson
OL,7,Fsaid recent months had been
OL,8,F"particularly difficult", but he hoped
OL,9,Fthe relationship with the American
OL,10,Fmilitary, which boosts the local
OL,11,Feconomy, continues for decades to come.
